       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. REPORT-COMPARISON.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 OLD-REPORT PIC X(30).
       01 NEW-REPORT PIC X(30).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "ENTER REFERENCE REPORT:"
           ACCEPT OLD-REPORT

           DISPLAY "ENTER NEW REPORT:"
           ACCEPT NEW-REPORT

           IF OLD-REPORT = NEW-REPORT
               DISPLAY "MATCH"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "REPORT DIFFERENCE FOUND"
           END-IF

           STOP RUN.